    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991500/extras/fdef77e424b1640dba2252762c8af3d9.avif?t=1722890084\" /></div><br>It is a casual bullet hell adventure game that brings nostalgia to any technology enthusiast. Become the annoying bug that you always hated. Use this bug to destroy as many computer components as you can, but watch out for those nasty capacitors, resistors, and even processors, they might have learned how to defend themselves!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991500/extras/489d5a68667a7517eb5bb7b99bd2b389.avif?t=1722890084\" /></div><br>Break down old-school pieces of technology. don't worry, it's just a game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991500/extras/87b2c75de34eab81c7ff174fa2468a76.avif?t=1722890084\" /></div><br>You are in control of the bug. Get your revenge for all the time your computer started acting weird.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991500/extras/86b01af92fd7d7304d92d51f3b4680f1.avif?t=1722890084\" /></div><br>Choose wisely between accuracy or power to get through levels faster, but you can always take on the challenge by not spending on any upgrades. The choice is yours!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991500/extras/fdef77e424b1640dba2252762c8af3d9.avif?t=1722890084\" /></div><br>It is a casual bullet hell adventure game that brings nostalgia to any technology enthusiast. Become the annoying bug that you always hated. Use this bug to destroy as many computer components as you can, but watch out for those nasty capacitors, resistors, and even processors, they might have learned how to defend themselves!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991500/extras/489d5a68667a7517eb5bb7b99bd2b389.avif?t=1722890084\" /></div><br>Break down old-school pieces of technology. don't worry, it's just a game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991500/extras/87b2c75de34eab81c7ff174fa2468a76.avif?t=1722890084\" /></div><br>You are in control of the bug. Get your revenge for all the time your computer started acting weird.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991500/extras/86b01af92fd7d7304d92d51f3b4680f1.avif?t=1722890084\" /></div><br>Choose wisely between accuracy or power to get through levels faster, but you can always take on the challenge by not spending on any upgrades. The choice is yours!",
